<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopia is deepening its regional involvement by offering to host Sudanese dialogue and urging Sudanese parties to join mediation, while Ethiopian-linked drones killed four people and damaged a United Nations building in Khartoum. Ethiopian forces shelled Alamata, killing 14 civilians and prompting Amnesty International to call for a war crimes investigation in Tigray. Intelligence suggests coordination between Eritrean and Sudanese actors in drone strikes on Mekelle and Assosa. Ethiopian troops have regained control of border areas near Badme and clashes continue along the Afar-Somali border over territory, drought and resources. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPeUhJdlpRZG5aSUZHX3V2YWJqUXBNSFdpZXdtamZnaXdtcDB1SjdtQzlIVzNsOUxtWmdYOTh2S0lWSU16anZhSnhvcmdZSzJwSTM5b1lMSWJneng1dlVPNVRuLUliTWN5QVYxdXpuT0xUM1p1TGZUU3VKdzJybzRGbzdfbWhkWnFHZUpyOWlBd1R6ZE5WMFlIZUdZSlpWd3lXaW9IWEllUkdCZlh2YVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Agenzia Fides&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOeTE0cHFpaUFvTHM0MF9qbENWcWpkeXlTWjMtNElrNGtqR3pGTk1hRUZVVHB0ZWNDS3NNVVpuY1lzekVoYzRyLWpDWE96NjdaTzMwRUZjNzlkY3dYVGNlLVNyblE4c195RHVSVVl4VHY2TG9oeVJpZGhycHBpRUlrNnRVN081bTltV3RIaWg5M1lqdVFWdVJhS0NnSXFXb3NWTUkwRkhocmE2Rmtm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOUDVGZ2kteXJIdWw2bktqWFRBbkxSTHA4aDNWRnZuT1pSSnZCa3ZBYkRGcEM0SkE4bU9BX1V6YW5BRTRrdVoyNGFhTkhTcmItRlpMc3BMbERVSVZtM3RkdTM4bGkwWnZlcG5JeFBFR2dWdW9uTXVXTUZiTk9GMXNPTWEwMk9aQ0Q2TjFuOGlVOXRPRDdzbkRoRFhNWExleWFZRGNFMW1UMzFKeGg4aG1OSWpHOGl2WThQaElxaTJn?oc=5&quo